<title>UK: One Brent cargo in chains kept by BP - trade.</title>
<headline>One Brent cargo in chains kept by BP - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent cargo which turned wet on Tuesday was taken from the chains before the five o'clock deadline by British Petroleum, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the April 9-11 loading period.</p>
<p>-- S Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
